<description>&lt;p&gt;Linares, a former Venezuelan world champion boxer, was detained by US immigration while a gay man was appointed Venezuela's foreign minister, showing internal political shifts. Venezuelan workers launched a 24‑hour strike and protested at Miraflores Palace, and the government used US$12 billion of oil revenue to support the bolívar. A special-forces soldier who bet $400,000 on Maduro's removal made his first court appearance, and a marine died after going overboard in the first US military operation in the Caribbean. Nicolas Maduro is scheduled to stand trial on June 1 2027, and there were 2 battle-related deaths in 2007, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxNNXIyMjB0bmNDczNUZ2dldlNWWmJuZlFBX0lhZmJWVThuWVFIVlIzN2dDSXU2ai1QVTFjemxKQ2hENkUxZEFtekl6WktjazBKSkhocWZJRm5fXzZ6MFFGU052ZVpaWWNiaHNudkpRMTM1MUF6akdZOXp3azg0RkNxaUY2VUZTSV9JbWlUU2hGOF91WkcxQXV2NmRGZGpDbHZEbG9YejMwZjV6dkZ3Mm5LRHMwaDdnZzVLS2R5bw?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxQdVJkU2p2ZjdoMG1LZ2RhM056X2U1cG1zUnpBMGlSTWJPVFV4Nld3UF9iSWJWUXZXYVhXdVFleVJuVjJ5d0R0aHVjczFtTUVwYzRqWEZsSFNHRjNIcDlNNHBBVWhnSWQtOG5wSXBhS1hIQm1YdkFab1B4N1hmZERFYlhDX2YtU2J1WWFIbENyWmFvUXJ3TW1CV3loS2l4NEhPOTIyUDZhTVVCUWdpMXQtTkxDX01udVU5R0kxSDFTQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;U.S. News &amp;amp; World Report&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Crude Oil Prices Today | OilPrice.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxNTEFKcjJZcmIxSVc1dEVzRmxKOGtWYlplQVFBLXVkRXFwdThwWUlPNzZrMFNQVUpPd252cG9yWlRUQ1o4ZmtwVldubzgwcEtWNlJpUl94cWEyNjJDeVpHeWtoNFBTdEpQMUlJT3Nod3E1VW9vQUlBS2xWeWNWVjN1dkhaeFRGZFRGSlZ4dTVpQzhRa242SkNRclJBd2FDOGo1WkEyanUyWGk?oc=5